{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Hacker!<br>Net.Attack() is a bullet-heaven roguelite where you visually program your own attack algorithms using 190+ drag-and-drop nodes, then watch them execute in real-time combat against security system hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating attack algorithms using drag-and-drop programming nodes. Chain triggers, branch conditionals, and loop executions to create thousands of unique combinations. Your custom code unleashes bullet-heaven chaos automatically. You focus on strategy and survival while your algorithms execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.webm?t=1773400118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain nodes to spawn projectiles that multiply on impact. Let the enemies shooting at each other or loop execution to create sustained area-of-effect devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into hostile systems across multiple regions in a near-future cyberwar. Each region presents unique security protocols and escalating difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" width=1004 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.webm?t=1773400118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of security countermeasures in fast-paced bullet-heaven combat. Your custom-coded algorithms execute automatically based on the logic <strong>you engineer</strong>, unleashing storms of projectiles while you navigate the chaos. Each run pushes your builds to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple hacker characters, each with unique starting abilities and specializations. Potentially unlock nodes from other sets for even more complex combinations. Find your playstyle and engineer your personal path to dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DarkBits# with each chip extraction and exchange them on the DarkMarket for new operatives and permanent power upgrades across runs. Uncover additional regions as you progress and gather bonus currency by completing missions like the Daily Challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shit Happens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/6dbcc53ebef1f6bdd210160314f890b3747f3840.jpg"},{"name":"Adaptable Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/872b34c067c6c397643b47f63ba3b8f7e7779d80.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s Get Out of Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/01dd4a2d082233f559a4905b5c1f1e5ced95ccc5.jpg"},{"name":"God Mode Admin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/e04f9b573dc6fe7ce587ca97f8aa75b0951e126e.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing Grace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/1317e060492331c44afefeef27102257e9d7f00a.jpg"},{"name":"Z13 Can Use This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/7b67fcf49c76b5d06043d58d1e06eaac2a7ffd9f.jpg"},{"name":"The Public Will Know","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/5fea6f7fbe970eba8b9917b03aa349d362ae7d7e.jpg"},{"name":"Now Back to Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/038a988fee857e42999527eabf113901751e2033.jpg"},{"name":"Grandma Relies on COBOL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/2e12da44d2d8d33274416a51fd852c580edb456a.jpg"},{"name":"20 Minutes until Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/a87c75630773b06fd9f21f45e582dcd1cb97b135.jpg"}],"total":56},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047370?t=1773400118","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047370?t=1773400118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/3d0b063e909cc0482d479bbfb4d34dd5dc140849/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773400118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/3d0b063e909cc0482d479bbfb4d34dd5dc140849/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773400118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Is this Game something for you?</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>190+ Programming Nodes</strong> - Build unlimited algorithmic combinations\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13 Hacker Characters</strong> - Unique starting abilities and specializations\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Regions</strong> - Hack your way through areas with increasing security: 3 Regions, 7 Layers, 5 Difficulties \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes </strong>- Progress through Levels, experiment in Sandbox Mode, race against the clock in a timed 20 Minute Hack, or compete in Daily Challenges\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Market Upgrades</strong> - Spend extracted Files on permanent power upgrades\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Heaven Combat</strong> - Your code defines your attack patterns and strength\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No RNG Excuses</strong>\u00a0- Deterministic challenge where logic and skill beats luck\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Programming</strong> - Accessible to beginners, infinite depth for masters\u00a0</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Hacker!<br>Net.Attack() is a bullet-heaven roguelite where you visually program your own attack algorithms using 190+ drag-and-drop nodes, then watch them execute in real-time combat against security system hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating attack algorithms using drag-and-drop programming nodes. Chain triggers, branch conditionals, and loop executions to create thousands of unique combinations. Your custom code unleashes bullet-heaven chaos automatically. You focus on strategy and survival while your algorithms execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.webm?t=1773400118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain nodes to spawn projectiles that multiply on impact. Let the enemies shooting at each other or loop execution to create sustained area-of-effect devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into hostile systems across multiple regions in a near-future cyberwar. Each region presents unique security protocols and escalating difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" width=1004 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.webm?t=1773400118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of security countermeasures in fast-paced bullet-heaven combat. Your custom-coded algorithms execute automatically based on the logic <strong>you engineer</strong>, unleashing storms of projectiles while you navigate the chaos. Each run pushes your builds to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.webp?t=1773400118\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.poster.avif?t=1773400118\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple hacker characters, each with unique starting abilities and specializations. Potentially unlock nodes from other sets for even more complex combinations. Find your playstyle and engineer your personal path to dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect DarkBits# with each chip extraction and exchange them on the DarkMarket for new operatives and permanent power upgrades across runs. Uncover additional regions as you progress and gather bonus currency by completing missions like the Daily Challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/b95b19f5877d3e9455998b25e8c0f33dba224f55/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773400118","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright ByteRockers' Games GmbH & Co. KG. All rights reserved. ByteRockers Games is a trademark registered in Germany and the USA.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047370/632740091/7d9bb2f4d0f6de559674b717ce3c13e9b7d5b38a/1773307061/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773307756","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047370/632740091/7d9bb2f4d0f6de559674b717ce3c13e9b7d5b38a/1773307061/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773307756","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047370/632740091/7d9bb2f4d0f6de559674b717ce3c13e9b7d5b38a/1773307061/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773307756","id":257301936,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257301936/c3d8c7b83c9534cbf5670c1c9ca0dab52457606f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773307756"}],"name":"Net.Attack() - Code or Die!","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_lice